Package: CanWestSiteIndexCFS
Type: Package
Title: Site Index Tools for Western Canadian PSP and Growth Workflows
Version: 0.3.0
Date: 2026-09-24
Authors@R: c(
  person("Derek Felix", "Sattler", email = "Derek.Sattler@nrcan-rncan.gc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre")),
  person("Yong", "Luo", email = "Yong.Luo@gov.bc.ca", role = "ctb", comment = "Original SIndexR package author"),
  person("Ken", "Polsson", role = "ctb", comment = "Original Sindex C implementation")
 )
Description: Site index estimation for western Canadian forest inventory and
  growth-and-yield workflows. Wraps the British Columbia SiteTools ('Sindex')
  height-age routines, and adds Alberta 'GYPSY' (Huang et al. 2009) height-age
  and site index functions, Alberta and Saskatchewan species site index
  conversion equations, and published site index lookup tables keyed by
  ecosite, ecosite phase and edatope for British Columbia, Alberta,
  Saskatchewan and Manitoba. Examples of usage for Permanent Sample Plots
  (PSP) and growth-and-yield models are provided.
